      "id": "sol.ahsme-1970-p6.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Completing the square gives \\[ x^2+8x=(x+4)^2-16. \\] Since \\((x+4)^2\\ge0,\\) the minimum occurs at \\(x=-4\\) and equals \\(-16.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B.",
